not on Friday's. They're really busy with the $5 medium and it would slow service down. #BlackOwned"},{"business_id":"1hId-t2dmHYuhmlmW3UxdA","review_id":"VO6PCQWSnHhZ4GRZZJnlag","date":"2020-11-14T15:02:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9182962775230408,"text_excerpt":"I don't visit this Smoothie King often but I did on $5 Friday. I mistakenly ordered two smoothies and was unable to cancel one. I went into the store, that was very clean and well kept. Customers were social distanced. The lady taking orders was very kind and willing to help, she may have been the owner. She was nice enough to cancel one of my smoothies and refund my money. There were younger people working, hustling hard to get those smoothies out, all were courteous and professional. I will try to patronize this location more often."},{"business_id":"1hId-t2dmHYuhmlmW3UxdA","review_id":"-1s5-pQdR0hNIrqBplHj-A","date":"2011-07-07T23:48:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8576427102088928,"text_excerpt":"Nice location. Great smoothies"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1hId-t2dmHYuhmlmW3UxdA","photo_id":"U7PIu5Fyo13mpSMeNSF1mQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/U7PIu5Fyo13mpSMeNSF1mQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
